# What each of the twelve territories has, per resource.
#
# `spec/planet.md`: for each resource, a territory has room for some number of extractors,
# and a density that each of them yields. One line per territory per resource, taken from
# the table in releases/first-release.md - `3 x 4` is room for three, each yielding four.
#
# This was `add node` until P-149, one line per node, which was the shape when a node was a
# thing rather than a number. A territory has one answer per resource now, so `set resource`
# replaces rather than adds.
#
# Nothing here is hardcoded data: every line below is a command, and the world is what
# running them produces.

# 1: the landing site. Everything works
{set-resource territory:1 resource:food extractors:3 density:4}
{set-resource territory:1 resource:metal extractors:3 density:4}
{set-resource territory:1 resource:energy extractors:3 density:4}

# 2: few dense food extractors
{set-resource territory:2 resource:food extractors:2 density:6}
{set-resource territory:2 resource:metal extractors:2 density:4}
{set-resource territory:2 resource:energy extractors:2 density:4}

# 3: many thin food extractors, same food total
{set-resource territory:3 resource:food extractors:6 density:2}
{set-resource territory:3 resource:metal extractors:2 density:4}
{set-resource territory:3 resource:energy extractors:2 density:4}

# 4: the minimum a territory can be
{set-resource territory:4 resource:food extractors:1 density:2}
{set-resource territory:4 resource:metal extractors:4 density:5}
{set-resource territory:4 resource:energy extractors:4 density:5}

# 5: food density 1
{set-resource territory:5 resource:food extractors:3 density:1}
{set-resource territory:5 resource:metal extractors:8 density:8}
{set-resource territory:5 resource:energy extractors:8 density:8}

# 6: no metal
{set-resource territory:6 resource:food extractors:4 density:4}
{set-resource territory:6 resource:metal extractors:0 density:0}
{set-resource territory:6 resource:energy extractors:4 density:5}

# 7: no energy
{set-resource territory:7 resource:food extractors:4 density:4}
{set-resource territory:7 resource:metal extractors:4 density:5}
{set-resource territory:7 resource:energy extractors:0 density:0}

# 8: population without industry
{set-resource territory:8 resource:food extractors:6 density:6}
{set-resource territory:8 resource:metal extractors:1 density:2}
{set-resource territory:8 resource:energy extractors:1 density:2}

# 9: rich metal, too few hands to work it
{set-resource territory:9 resource:food extractors:2 density:3}
{set-resource territory:9 resource:metal extractors:6 density:8}
{set-resource territory:9 resource:energy extractors:1 density:2}

# 10: an energy depot
{set-resource territory:10 resource:food extractors:3 density:3}
{set-resource territory:10 resource:metal extractors:1 density:3}
{set-resource territory:10 resource:energy extractors:6 density:8}

# 11: the prize
{set-resource territory:11 resource:food extractors:5 density:6}
{set-resource territory:11 resource:metal extractors:5 density:6}
{set-resource territory:11 resource:energy extractors:5 density:6}

# 12: rich extractors, almost no workers
{set-resource territory:12 resource:food extractors:2 density:2}
{set-resource territory:12 resource:metal extractors:8 density:8}
{set-resource territory:12 resource:energy extractors:8 density:8}
